>  
> [ 
> uuid(5DBA73AC-264D-0000-028C-8E3802000000),
> version(1),
> endpoint("ncacn_ip_udp:[617]")
  
This is not a valid protocol sequence.  Use ncacn_ip_tcp or ncadg_ip_udp.
   
